    "content": "The Oscars are held at the Dolby Theatre in Ovation Hollywood (formerly Hollywood & Highland) on Hollywood Boulevard in Los Angeles, California. The venue has hosted the annual Academy Awards ceremony since 2001 and is contracted to host the event through 2028. Key Details About the Venue: Location: Hollywood Boulevard and Highland Avenue, Hollywood, California. Significance: It is a purpose-built venue for the Academy Awards and hosts other premier live events. Surroundings: Adjacent to the historic TCL Chinese Theatre and surrounded by the Ovation Hollywood shopping center. The ceremony occasionally takes place at other venues in Los Angeles, but the Dolby Theatre is considered the primary, consistent home of the Oscars.",
